{"title":"Career roadmap · Junior Data Scientist","role":"Junior Data Scientist","summary":"A Junior Data Scientist uses statistics, mathematics, programming and machine learning to extract insights from data and build predictive models that support business, scientific or operational decisions.","facts":{},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A Junior Data Scientist uses statistics, mathematics, programming and machine learning to extract insights from data and build predictive models that support business, scientific or operational decisions."},{"type":"p","text":"This degree combination is particularly strong because it combines:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Statistics → inference, probability, experimentation"},{"text":"Mathematics → optimisation, linear algebra, calculus"},{"text":"Computer Science → algorithms, programming, databases"},{"text":"Data Science → machine learning, modelling and deployment"}]},{"type":"h","text":"The strongest profile is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Statistics","Mathematics","Python","SQL","Machine Learning","Data Visualisation","Software Engineering","Business Understanding"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"A B.Sc can lead to junior data roles, but competitive Data Scientist positions may expect strong projects, internships and sometimes a master's degree. For many graduates, Data Analyst / ML Analyst / Junior Data Scientist is the practical entry route."}]},{"heading":"Career horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Stage","Primary focus"],"rows":[[{"text":"UG Year 1"},{"text":"Mathematics + statistics + programming"}],[{"text":"UG Year 2"},{"text":"Data structures + SQL + statistical computing"}],[{"text":"UG Year 3"},{"text":"Machine learning + projects + internships"}],[{"text":"Final year"},{"text":"Advanced ML + deployment + capstone"}],[{"text":"0–2 years"},{"text":"Data Analyst / Junior Data Scientist / ML Analyst"}],[{"text":"2–5 years"},{"text":"Data Scientist / ML Engineer"}],[{"text":"5–8 years"},{"text":"Senior Data Scientist"}],[{"text":"8–12 years"},{"text":"Lead Data Scientist / ML Lead"}],[{"text":"10+ years"},{"text":"Principal Data Scientist / AI Lead / Data Science Manager"}]]}]},{"heading":"What to build during the B.Sc","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Build the mathematical and programming foundation"},{"type":"h","text":"Mathematics"},{"type":"h","text":"Master:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Differential calculus"},{"text":"Integral calculus"},{"text":"Linear algebra"},{"text":"Matrices"},{"text":"Vectors"},{"text":"Discrete mathematics"},{"text":"Optimisation basics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Statistics"},{"type":"h","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Descriptive statistics"},{"text":"Probability"},{"text":"Random variables"},{"text":"Probability distributions"},{"text":"Expectation and variance"},{"text":"Sampling"},{"text":"Correlation"},{"text":"Regression fundamentals"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Programming"},{"type":"p","text":"Start with Python."},{"type":"h","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"h","text":"Python"},{"type":"h","text":"NumPy"},{"type":"h","text":"pandas"},{"type":"h","text":"Matplotlib"},{"type":"h","text":"Seaborn"},{"type":"h","text":"Also learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Functions"},{"text":"OOP"},{"text":"Exception handling"},{"text":"File handling"},{"text":"Modules"},{"text":"Virtual environments"},{"text":"Git/GitHub"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Data structures"},{"type":"h","text":"Study:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Arrays"},{"text":"Strings"},{"text":"Linked lists"},{"text":"Stacks"},{"text":"Queues"},{"text":"Hash tables"},{"text":"Trees"},{"text":"Graphs"},{"text":"Sorting"},{"text":"Searching"},{"text":"Big-O complexity"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2 — Become strong in data"},{"type":"h","text":"Statistics"},{"type":"h","text":"Move beyond basic statistics into:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Statistical inference"},{"text":"Hypothesis testing"},{"text":"Confidence intervals"},{"text":"ANOVA"},{"text":"Chi-square tests"},{"text":"t-tests"},{"text":"Regression"},{"text":"Logistic regression"},{"text":"Bayesian concepts"},{"text":"Sampling methods"},{"text":"Experimental design"}]},{"type":"h","text":"SQL"},{"type":"p","text":"This is essential."},{"type":"h","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"SELECT"},{"text":"WHERE"},{"text":"GROUP BY"},{"text":"HAVING"},{"text":"JOINs"},{"text":"Subqueries"},{"text":"CTEs"},{"text":"Window functions"},{"text":"CASE statements"},{"text":"Aggregations"},{"text":"Date/time functions"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Aim to solve practical SQL problems rather than memorising syntax."},{"type":"h","text":"Databases"},{"type":"h","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Relational databases"},{"text":"Primary/foreign keys"},{"text":"Normalisation"},{"text":"Indexing"},{"text":"Transactions"},{"text":"PostgreSQL/MySQL"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Data analysis"},{"type":"h","text":"Become comfortable with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"pandas"},{"text":"NumPy"},{"text":"Matplotlib"},{"text":"Seaborn"},{"text":"Jupyter"},{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"Power BI/Tableau"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3 — Machine learning"},{"type":"p","text":"This is the transition from data analyst to data scientist."},{"type":"h","text":"Supervised learning"},{"type":"h","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Linear regression"},{"text":"Ridge/Lasso"},{"text":"Logistic regression"},{"text":"Decision trees"},{"text":"Random forests"},{"text":"Gradient boosting"},{"text":"XGBoost/LightGBM concepts"},{"text":"k-NN"},{"text":"SVM"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Unsupervised learning"},{"type":"h","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"k-Means"},{"text":"Hierarchical clustering"},{"text":"DBSCAN"},{"text":"PCA"},{"text":"Dimensionality reduction"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Model evaluation"},{"type":"h","text":"Understand deeply:"},{"type":"h","text":"Classification"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Accuracy"},{"text":"Precision"},{"text":"Recall"},{"text":"F1"},{"text":"ROC-AUC"},{"text":"PR-AUC"},{"text":"Confusion matrix"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Regression"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"MAE"},{"text":"MSE"},{"text":"RMSE"},{"text":"R²"},{"text":"MAPE, where appropriate"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Critical concepts"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Train/validation/test split"},{"text":"Cross-validation"},{"text":"Data leakage"},{"text":"Overfitting"},{"text":"Underfitting"},{"text":"Bias-variance trade-off"},{"text":"Feature engineering"},{"text":"Class imbalance"},{"text":"Hyperparameter tuning"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A student who understands why a model fails is much stronger than one who only knows how to call fit()."},{"type":"h","text":"Final year — Advanced data science + deployment"},{"type":"h","text":"Advanced machine learning"},{"type":"h","text":"Learn selected topics such as:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Ensemble learning"},{"text":"Gradient boosting"},{"text":"Time-series forecasting"},{"text":"Recommendation systems"},{"text":"NLP"},{"text":"Computer vision"},{"text":"Anomaly detection"},{"text":"Survival analysis"},{"text":"Causal inference fundamentals"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Do not attempt to master everything."},{"type":"p","text":"Choose 1–2 specialisations."},{"type":"h","text":"Deep learning"},{"type":"h","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Neural networks"},{"text":"Backpropagation"},{"text":"Optimisation"},{"text":"CNNs"},{"text":"RNN/LSTM concepts"},{"text":"Transformers"},{"text":"Embeddings"},{"text":"Transfer learning"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Framework options:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"PyTorch"},{"text":"TensorFlow/Keras"}]},{"type":"p","text":"For a modern data-science profile, understanding transformers and modern foundation-model workflows is useful, but classical statistics and ML should remain strong."}]},{"heading":"Build serious projects","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Avoid having 15 tiny notebook projects."},{"type":"p","text":"Build 4–6 strong projects."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 1 — Business prediction"},{"type":"h","text":"Example:"},{"type":"h","text":"Customer Churn Prediction"},{"type":"h","text":"Pipeline:"},{"type":"h","text":"Raw data"},{"type":"h","text":"EDA"},{"type":"h","text":"Data cleaning"},{"type":"h","text":"Feature engineering"},{"type":"h","text":"Statistical analysis"},{"type":"h","text":"Model training"},{"type":"h","text":"Evaluation"},{"type":"h","text":"Explainability"},{"type":"h","text":"Deployment"},{"type":"h","text":"Project 2 — Time-series forecasting"},{"type":"h","text":"Example:"},{"type":"h","text":"Retail Demand Forecasting"},{"type":"h","text":"Use:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Time-series analysis"},{"text":"Feature engineering"},{"text":"Forecasting models"},{"text":"Error analysis"},{"text":"Dashboard"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 3 — Recommendation system"},{"type":"h","text":"Build:"},{"type":"h","text":"Product/Movie Recommendation Engine"},{"type":"h","text":"Explore:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Collaborative filtering"},{"text":"Content-based filtering"},{"text":"Similarity"},{"text":"Ranking"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 4 — NLP"},{"type":"h","text":"Example:"},{"type":"h","text":"Customer Feedback Intelligence System"},{"type":"h","text":"Pipeline:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Text","cleaning","embeddings/features","classification/topic analysis","dashboard"]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 5 — End-to-end ML application"},{"type":"h","text":"Build a complete application:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Data","Model","API","UI","Deployment"]},{"type":"h","text":"Possible stack:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Python"},{"text":"scikit-learn/PyTorch"},{"text":"FastAPI"},{"text":"PostgreSQL"},{"text":"Docker"},{"text":"Cloud deployment"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 6 — Statistical research project"},{"type":"p","text":"Because the degree contains statistics, include at least one project involving:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Hypothesis testing"},{"text":"Regression"},{"text":"Experimental design"},{"text":"Confidence intervals"},{"text":"Causal reasoning"}]},{"type":"p","text":"This differentiates the student from candidates who only know machine-learning libraries."},{"type":"h","text":"Final-year capstone"},{"type":"p","text":"A strong capstone should solve a genuine problem."},{"type":"h","text":"Example"},{"type":"h","text":"Intelligent Demand Forecasting & Decision System"},{"type":"h","text":"Components:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Historical sales data"},{"text":"Exploratory analysis"},{"text":"Statistical modelling"},{"text":"Forecasting"},{"text":"Machine learning"},{"text":"Uncertainty estimates"},{"text":"Dashboard"},{"text":"API"},{"text":"Deployment"}]},{"type":"flow","items":["This demonstrates statistics","computing","ML","engineering","business thinking."],"sep":"+"}]},{"heading":"Data science portfolio","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Each project should have:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Problem statement"},{"text":"Dataset description"},{"text":"Data-quality analysis"},{"text":"Exploratory analysis"},{"text":"Statistical reasoning"},{"text":"Feature engineering"},{"text":"Baseline model"},{"text":"Model comparison"},{"text":"Evaluation"},{"text":"Error analysis"},{"text":"Explainability"},{"text":"Business/scientific interpretation"},{"text":"Deployment, where appropriate"},{"text":"README"},{"text":"Reproducible code"}]},{"type":"h","text":"GitHub structure"},{"type":"h","text":"project/"},{"type":"h","text":"├── README.md"},{"type":"h","text":"├── data/"},{"type":"h","text":"├── notebooks/"},{"type":"h","text":"├── src/"},{"type":"h","text":"├── tests/"},{"type":"h","text":"├── requirements.txt"},{"type":"h","text":"├── Dockerfile"},{"type":"h","text":"└── app/"},{"type":"p","text":"The goal is to demonstrate that you can build and communicate a data solution, not just produce a notebook."}]},{"heading":"Internships","kind":"internships","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Highest-value internships"},{"type":"h","text":"Target:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Data Science"},{"text":"Data Analytics"},{"text":"Machine Learning"},{"text":"Business Intelligence"},{"text":"Statistical Analytics"},{"text":"Risk Analytics"},{"text":"Product Analytics"},{"text":"Research Analytics"},{"text":"AI/ML"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Strong industries"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"FinTech"},{"text":"E-commerce"},{"text":"Healthcare"},{"text":"SaaS"},{"text":"Manufacturing"},{"text":"Telecom"},{"text":"Logistics"},{"text":"Insurance"},{"text":"Retail"},{"text":"Consulting"},{"text":"Research"}]},{"type":"h","text":"What to avoid"},{"type":"h","text":"An internship where the entire role is:"},{"type":"h","text":"Excel data entry + manual reporting"},{"type":"p","text":"may provide limited data-science growth."},{"type":"h","text":"Prefer roles involving:"},{"type":"flow","items":["SQL","Python","statistics","analysis","modelling","real datasets."],"sep":"+"}]},{"heading":"Certifications and learning","kind":"certifications","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Certificates are secondary to skills."},{"type":"h","text":"Useful learning areas"},{"type":"h","text":"Python"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"NumPy"},{"text":"pandas"},{"text":"scikit-learn"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Statistics"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Probability"},{"text":"Inference"},{"text":"Regression"},{"text":"Experimental design"}]},{"type":"h","text":"SQL"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"PostgreSQL/MySQL"},{"text":"Advanced SQL"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Machine Learning"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"scikit-learn"},{"text":"Model evaluation"},{"text":"Feature engineering"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Deep Learning"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"PyTorch or TensorFlow"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Cloud"},{"type":"h","text":"Choose one:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"AWS"},{"text":"Azure"},{"text":"Google Cloud"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Advanced"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Docker"},{"text":"MLflow"},{"text":"Airflow"},{"text":"Spark"},{"text":"Kubernetes basics"},{"text":"Feature stores"},{"text":"Model monitoring"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Don't attempt all of these simultaneously."}]},{"heading":"MLOps and deployment","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A modern Junior Data Scientist should understand what happens after model training."},{"type":"h","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"h","text":"Model"},{"type":"h","text":"API"},{"type":"h","text":"Container"},{"type":"h","text":"Cloud"},{"type":"h","text":"Monitoring"},{"type":"h","text":"Retraining"},{"type":"h","text":"Tools"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"FastAPI"},{"text":"Docker"},{"text":"GitHub Actions"},{"text":"MLflow"},{"text":"AWS/Azure/GCP"},{"text":"PostgreSQL"},{"text":"Basic Linux"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Model versioning"},{"text":"Experiment tracking"},{"text":"Reproducibility"},{"text":"Data drift"},{"text":"Model drift"},{"text":"Monitoring"},{"text":"Deployment"}]}]},{"heading":"Generative AI","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A modern data scientist should understand GenAI without abandoning classical ML."},{"type":"h","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"LLM fundamentals"},{"text":"Embeddings"},{"text":"Vector search"},{"text":"RAG"},{"text":"Prompt engineering"},{"text":"Structured outputs"},{"text":"Evaluation"},{"text":"Fine-tuning concepts"},{"text":"LLM APIs"},{"text":"Retrieval pipelines"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Example project"},{"type":"h","text":"Enterprise Document Intelligence System"},{"type":"h","text":"Documents"},{"type":"h","text":"Parsing"},{"type":"h","text":"Chunking"},{"type":"h","text":"Embeddings"},{"type":"h","text":"Vector database"},{"type":"h","text":"Retrieval"},{"type":"h","text":"LLM"},{"type":"h","text":"Evaluation"},{"type":"h","text":"API/UI"},{"type":"p","text":"But don't present an LLM wrapper as your only data-science project."}]},{"heading":"Careers you can be hired as","kind":"careers","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Direct entry roles"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Junior Data Scientist"},{"text":"Data Analyst"},{"text":"Junior Data Analyst"},{"text":"Data Science Associate"},{"text":"ML Analyst"},{"text":"Business Intelligence Analyst"},{"text":"Product Analyst"},{"text":"Statistical Analyst"},{"text":"Research Data Analyst"},{"text":"Decision Scientist — Junior"},{"text":"Risk Analyst"},{"text":"Quantitative Analyst — Junior"}]},{"type":"h","text":"After experience"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Data Scientist"},{"text":"Machine Learning Engineer"},{"text":"Applied Scientist"},{"text":"Product Data Scientist"},{"text":"Decision Scientist"},{"text":"Senior Data Scientist"},{"text":"ML Engineer"},{"text":"Research Scientist"}]}]},{"heading":"What recruiters may test","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Statistics"},{"type":"h","text":"Expect:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Bayes theorem"},{"text":"Probability distributions"},{"text":"Hypothesis testing"},{"text":"p-values"},{"text":"Confidence intervals"},{"text":"Sampling"},{"text":"Regression"},{"text":"Correlation vs causation"},{"text":"Experimental design"}]},{"type":"h","text":"SQL"},{"type":"h","text":"Expect:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"JOINs"},{"text":"CTEs"},{"text":"Window functions"},{"text":"Ranking"},{"text":"Aggregations"},{"text":"Deduplication"},{"text":"Cohort analysis"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Python"},{"type":"h","text":"Expect:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Lists/dictionaries"},{"text":"Functions"},{"text":"OOP basics"},{"text":"pandas"},{"text":"NumPy"},{"text":"Data manipulation"},{"text":"Debugging"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Machine learning"},{"type":"h","text":"Expect:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Overfitting"},{"text":"Cross-validation"},{"text":"Feature 