cs"}]},{"type":"h","text":"NLP/GenAI"},{"type":"h","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Transformers"},{"text":"Embeddings"},{"text":"RAG"},{"text":"Evaluation"},{"text":"LLM systems"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Computer Vision"},{"type":"h","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"CNNs"},{"text":"Detection"},{"text":"Segmentation"},{"text":"Vision transformers"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Quantitative Analytics"},{"type":"h","text":"Focus heavily on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Probability"},{"text":"Statistics"},{"text":"Stochastic processes"},{"text":"Optimisation"},{"text":"Time series"}]}]},{"heading":"2040–2046 evolution","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Data science will increasingly move from:"},{"type":"h","text":"Manual analysis"},{"type":"h","text":"toward:"},{"type":"flow","items":["AI-assisted analytics","automated modelling","decision intelligence"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Future data scientists will increasingly need to work with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Autonomous analytics agents"},{"text":"Synthetic data"},{"text":"Foundation models"},{"text":"Multimodal data"},{"text":"Causal AI"},{"text":"Real-time analytics"},{"text":"Automated experimentation"},{"text":"AI evaluation"},{"text":"Responsible AI"},{"text":"Privacy-preserving ML"},{"text":"Data governance"}]},{"type":"h","text":"But the fundamentals remain:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Probability","Statistics","Mathematics","Programming","Critical Thinking"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"AI tools may automate model creation, but understanding whether the model is statistically valid and whether the conclusion is actually justified remains a core human skill."},{"type":"h","text":"Recommended final skill stack"},{"type":"h","text":"Tier 1 — Non-negotiable"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Python"},{"text":"SQL"},{"text":"Probability"},{"text":"Statistics"},{"text":"Linear algebra"},{"text":"pandas"},{"text":"NumPy"},{"text":"Data visualisation"},{"text":"Machine learning"},{"text":"Git"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Tier 2 — Strong differentiators"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Advanced SQL"},{"text":"Experimental design"},{"text":"Causal inference"},{"text":"Time-series"},{"text":"Feature engineering"},{"text":"XGBoost/gradient boosting"},{"text":"Model explainability"},{"text":"FastAPI"},{"text":"Docker"},{"text":"Cloud"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Tier 3 — Modern AI"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"PyTorch"},{"text":"Transformers"},{"text":"Embeddings"},{"text":"RAG"},{"text":"LLM evaluation"},{"text":"MLflow"},{"text":"AI agents"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Tier 4 — Domain knowledge"},{"type":"h","text":"Choose one:"},{"type":"p","text":"Finance / Healthcare / Retail / SaaS / Manufacturing / Telecom / Marketing / Logistics / Scientific Research"},{"type":"h","text":"Ideal 3-year portfolio"},{"type":"h","text":"By graduation, aim for:"},{"type":"table","header":["Project","Demonstrates"],"rows":[[{"text":"Statistical analysis"},{"text":"Statistics"}],[{"text":"Churn/risk prediction"},{"text":"Classical ML"}],[{"text":"Time-series forecasting"},{"text":"Forecasting"}],[{"text":"NLP/GenAI project"},{"text":"Modern AI"}],[{"text":"End-to-end deployed ML system"},{"text":"Engineering"}],[{"text":"Domain-specific project"},{"text":"Business/scientific understanding"}]]}]},{"heading":"Target progression","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","Target"],"rows":[[{"text":"Year 1"},{"text":"Python + Mathematics + Statistics"}],[{"text":"Year 2"},{"text":"SQL + Data Analysis + Advanced Statistics"}],[{"text":"Year 3"},{"text":"Machine Learning + Internship"}],[{"text":"Final year"},{"text":"Deep Learning + Deployment + Capstone"}],[{"text":"0–2 years"},{"text":"Data Analyst / Junior Data Scientist"}],[{"text":"2–5 years"},{"text":"Data Scientist / ML Engineer"}],[{"text":"5–8 years"},{"text":"Senior Data Scientist"}],[{"text":"8–12 years"},{"text":"Lead / Staff Data Scientist"}],[{"text":"10+ years"},{"text":"Principal Data Scientist / AI Lead / Data Science Manager"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Best overall strategy"},{"type":"p","text":"For B.Sc Statistics & Computer Science / Mathematics & Computing, the student should exploit the degree's biggest advantage: mathematical and statistical depth combined with computing."},{"type":"h","text":"The strongest route is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Statistics + Mathematics","Python + SQL","Data Analysis","Machine Learning","Deep Learning / GenAI","Deployment + MLOps","Domain specialisation"]},{"type":"p","text":"The biggest mistake would be becoming a \"certificate-heavy, notebook-only\" candidate."},{"type":"p","text":"The strongest graduate profile is someone who can take a real problem from:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Raw data","statistical reasoning","SQL/Python analysis","ML model","evaluation","deployment","business/scientific decision"]},{"type":"p","text":"That combination makes the B.Sc a strong foundation for Junior Data Scientist, Data Analyst, ML Analyst and eventually advanced Data Science/AI roles."}]}]}